## Context

- Completed all 4 analyst interpretation tasks for KEAP1/NRF2 Pan-Cancer Dependency Atlas
- Journal entries: #2661 (Phase 1-2), #2663 (Phase 3), #2664 (Phase 4), #2667 (clinical prioritization)
